# Markdown preview: images sit in the flow like a browser lays them out: inline in text, in table cells, centered.
size 120x40
config
{"lsp": {"enabled": false}, "image_protocol": "kitty"}
end
copy tools/e2e/assets/shot-a.png shots/a.png
copy tools/e2e/assets/shot-b.png shots/b.png
file notes.md
# Gallery

Intro ![logo](shots/a.png) then text.
end
run notes.md
wait Gallery
key ctrl+p
type toggle split
wait Markdown: Toggle Split
key enter
wait ━━━━
snap inline An image inside a paragraph sits inline on the text baseline (a kitty terminal draws the picture in those cells).
file notes.md
# Gallery

Intro ![logo](shots/a.png) then text.

<table>
<tr>
<td><img src="shots/a.png" alt="First"><br><em>First: a caption.</em></td>
<td><img src="shots/b.png" alt="Second"><br><em>Second: another one.</em></td>
</tr>
</table>
end
wait 1/11
snap table A screenshot table keeps its columns: each image fills its cell with the italic caption under it.
file notes.md
# Gallery

Intro ![logo](shots/a.png) then text.

<table>
<tr>
<td><img src="shots/a.png" alt="First"><br><em>First: a caption.</em></td>
<td><img src="shots/b.png" alt="Second"><br><em>Second: another one.</em></td>
</tr>
</table>

<p><img src="shots/gone.png" alt="Missing"> keeps its alt text inline.</p>
end
wait [image: Missing]
snap missing A missing image file stays [image: Missing] inside its text.
file notes.md
# Gallery

Intro ![logo](shots/a.png) then text.

<table>
<tr>
<td><img src="shots/a.png" alt="First"><br><em>First: a caption.</em></td>
<td><img src="shots/b.png" alt="Second"><br><em>Second: another one.</em></td>
</tr>
</table>

<p><img src="shots/gone.png" alt="Missing"> keeps its alt text inline.</p>

<p align="center">
  <img src="shots/b.png"
       width="200">
</p>
end
wait 1/18
snap multiline An <img> tag split over several lines renders, its width attribute honoured and centered by its paragraph.
